# Review candidate only. Apply after verified operator key login and console recovery.
# Replace the reviewed early local snippet; a late include may not override policy.
PermitRootLogin no
PasswordAuthentication no
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
PubkeyAuthentication yes
AuthenticationMethods publickey
PermitEmptyPasswords no
X11Forwarding no
MaxAuthTries 4
LoginGraceTime 60
